spans.s:
पट m. (woven) cloth, blanket, garment;
 picture, image of
(—˚);
 f. ई piece of cloth, screen, curtain (d.).

पट्ट m. plate, tablet;
 cloth, bandage, ligature, frontlet,
turban (cf. पट).

पटल n. ई f. cover, veil, screen, roof, basket, chest,
heap, mass, multitude;
 n. & m. division, section, chapter of a book.

पाटल a. pale-red;
 m. pale-red colour, redness;
 N. of a
tree, n. its blossom, f. आ = both.

पटु a. sharp, pointed, pungent, acute, fierce;
 piercing (ray
of light), clear, shrill (sound);
 violent, strong, intense;
 clever,
skilful in, fit for (loc. or —˚);
 n. adv. — m. N. of a man, pl. of a
people.

पट्टक m. पट्टिका f. plate, tablet, cloth, bandage;
 n.
also patent, document.
